1. Add `audit_log` + trigger function, attach to `accounts`, `orders`, and any other write-bearing tables (`users`, `sessions` if mutable).
2. Extend `db.write()` to set the three GUCs from an actor (via `AsyncLocalStorage`, set in `sessionUser`).
3. Revoke `UPDATE`/`DELETE` on `audit_log` from the app role.
4. Add the CI coverage check.
5. Build a read-only query/export surface for the compliance team (by actor, table, row, date range).

